// Your Apple Developer team id - the ONE place to change when building
// ClaudeX under your own account. Find it in the certificate's OU field:
//
//   security find-certificate -c "Apple Development" -p | openssl x509 -noout -subject
//
// Note this is NOT the identifier printed in parentheses after the email in
// `security find-identity` - that one is the certificate id and will not work.
//
// The App Group is derived from it, so app and widget always agree.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = 74XZ56V5VY
